usage: plot_isoform_usage [-h] [-o OUTPUT] [--min_reads MIN_READS]
                          [--palette PALETTE]
                          isoforms counts_matrix gene_name

Produces two images, one of the isoform models and another of the usage
proportions. The isoforms plotted are the most highly expressed across all the
samples; the minor ones are aggregated into a gray bar. --min_reads and
--palette plot more of them.

positional arguments:
  isoforms              isoforms in bed format
  counts_matrix         isoform counts
  gene_name             Name of gene, must correspond with the gene names in
                        the isoform and counts matrix files

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -o, --output OUTPUT   prefix used for output files (default: the gene name)
  --min_reads MIN_READS
                        minimum number of total supporting reads for an
                        isoform to be plotted (default: 6)
  --palette PALETTE     a palette file, to plot more than 7 isoforms at once
                        or to change the colors used: a line of one hex color
                        for each isoform
